{"title":"돈게쓰","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=tfJ8t/hAd4OqjOFR/m3541Kii52ouQHGJ9s4gEK&filename=th3","synopsis":"20년 전에 적대 조직 사무실에 로켓 런처를 갈긴놈이라고.\n흔히들 로켓 마사라고 해.\n\n시대의 변화를 따라가지 못한 채 여전히 자신의 주먹 하나만을\n믿고 살아가는 남자 사와다 마사토시! (통칭 로켓 마사)\n동네의, 아니 조직의 문제아인 그는 언제나 사건과 말썽을 기다린다!\n사건을 불러일으키는 꼴통이지만 그의 남자다움은 진짜다!\n낭만을 아는 마흔 살 핵주먹 사와다 마사토시, 등장!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":62,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":89,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":94,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":89,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":66,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":85,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":121,"change":{"type":"down","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":146,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":110,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":101,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":67}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":196,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":222,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":147,"change":{"type":"up","amount":75}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":86,"change":{"type":"up","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":170,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":67,"change":{"type":"up","amount":103}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":161,"change":{"type":"down","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":126,"change":{"type":"up","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-09